{"unit_id": "tag:01PK:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。设<MATH_0003>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>模（module）。存在\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>一个有向集（directed set）<MATH_0005>（见《范畴（Categories）》定义<REF_0001>），\n<STRUCT_0003>一个系统（system）<MATH_0006>，它以<MATH_0007>为指标并取值于<MATH_0008>（见《范畴（Categories）》定义<REF_0002>），\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0009>模（modules）之间的态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0010>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n使得每个<MATH_0011>都是有限表示（finite presentation）的，并且态射（morphisms）<MATH_0012>诱导一个同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0013>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "directed set", "target_term": "有向集"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该引理所讨论的概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "底概形的拟紧性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "底概形的拟分离性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "结构层或其限制上的模。"}, {"source_term": "directed set", "target_term": "有向集", "context": "用来标引正向系统的有向集。"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为范畴。"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统", "context": "以给定有向集为指标的系统。"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为范畴。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "同一系数层上的模。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所考虑范畴中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所考虑范畴中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "模或茎之间的同构。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PK:proof", "translation": "这是引理<REF_0001>与《范畴（Categories）》引理<REF_0002>的直接推论（还用到<MATH_0001>模（modules）的层（sheaves）范畴（category）中存在余极限（colimits）这一事实，见《层（Sheaves）》第<REF_0003>节）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为范畴。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "同一系数层上的模。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "由给定系数层上的模构成的层。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "用对象及其态射给出的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "模层范畴中的余极限。"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为层。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:086M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。设<MATH_0003>是一个有限型（finite type）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>模（module）。那么可写成<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>是有限表示（finite presentation）的，且所有转移映射（transition maps）<MATH_0007>都是满射（surjective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "转移映射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该引理所讨论的概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "底概形的拟紧性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "底概形的拟分离性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "模或层的有限型性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "结构层或其限制上的模。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "转移映射", "context": "系统在不同指标之间的转移映射。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "所考察映射的满射性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:086M:proof", "translation": "将<MATH_0001>写为有限表示（finitely presented）的<MATH_0002>模（modules）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit）（引理<REF_0001>）。我们断言，<MATH_0003>是满射（surjective），对某个<MATH_0004>而言。具体地，选取一个有限（finite）的仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>。选取截面（sections）<MATH_0006>，使它们生成（generating）<MATH_0007>，见引理<REF_0002>。由《层（Sheaves）》引理<REF_0003>可知，<MATH_0008>属于<MATH_0009>的像（image），只要<MATH_0010>足够大（large）。因此<MATH_0011>是满射（surjective），只要<MATH_0012>足够大（large）。选取这样的<MATH_0013>，令<MATH_0014>为下列映射（map）的核（kernel）：\n<MATH_0015>。将<MATH_0016>写成其有限型（finite type）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）子模（submodules）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit）（引理<REF_0004>）。于是<MATH_0017>就是该引理所提问题的一个解。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "generating", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "形容具有有限表示的模。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "同一系数层上的模。"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限", "context": "以滤过范畴为指标的余极限。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "所考察映射的满射性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "所取开覆盖由有限多个开集组成。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "覆盖中使用的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "由开集组成的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "生成给定模的截面。"}, {"source_term": "generating", "target_term": "生成", "context": "截面生成给定模。"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为层。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "给定映射的像。"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大", "context": "指标达到足够大的取值。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "所考察映射的满射性质。"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大", "context": "指标达到足够大的取值。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "模、层或茎之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "给定映射的核。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "模或层的有限型性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模", "context": "包含于给定模中的子模。"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限", "context": "以滤过范畴为指标的余极限。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:080V:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个有限型（finite type）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>模（module）。设<MATH_0004>是一个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open），使得<MATH_0005>是有限表示（finite presentation）的。那么存在一个<MATH_0006>模（modules）的映射（map）<MATH_0007>，满足\n（a）<MATH_0008>是有限表示（finite presentation）的，\n（b）<MATH_0009>是满射（surjective），且\n（c）<MATH_0010>是同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": ["a", "b", "c"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "底概形的拟紧性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "底概形的拟分离性质。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该引理所讨论的概形。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "模或层的有限型性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "结构层或其限制上的模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集", "context": "具有拟紧性的开集，亦用于修饰开邻域。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "同一系数层上的模。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "模、层或茎之间