{"unit_id": "tag:080V:proof", "translation": "将<MATH_0001>写为一个有向余极限（directed colimit），其中每个<MATH_0002>都是有限表示（finite presentation）的，见引理<REF_0001>。选取一个有限（finite）的仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，并选取有限多个（finitely many）截面（sections）<MATH_0004>，使它们生成（generating）<MATH_0005>，见引理<REF_0002>。由《层（Sheaves）》引理<REF_0003>可知，<MATH_0006>属于<MATH_0007>的像（image），只要<MATH_0008>足够大（large）。因此<MATH_0009>是满射（surjective），只要<MATH_0010>足够大（large）。选取这样的<MATH_0011>，令<MATH_0012>为下列映射（map）的核（kernel）：\n<MATH_0013>。由于<MATH_0014>是有限表示（finite presentation）的，可知<MATH_0015>是有限型（finite type）的，见《模（Modules）》引理<REF_0004>。因此，我们可以找到一个有限型（finite type）拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）子模（submodule）<MATH_0016>，使得<MATH_0017>，见引理<REF_0005>。于是\n<MATH_0018>\n连同给定的映射（map）<MATH_0019>构成一个解。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "generating", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "以有向集为指标的余极限。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "所取开覆盖由有限多个开集组成。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "覆盖中使用的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "由开集组成的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个", "context": "所选用于生成给定模的截面数目有限。"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "生成给定模的截面。"}, {"source_term": "generating", "target_term": "生成", "context": "截面生成给定模。"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为层。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "给定映射的像。"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大", "context": "指标达到足够大的取值。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "所考察映射的满射性质。"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大", "context": "指标达到足够大的取值。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "模、层或茎之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "给定映射的核。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "模或层的有限型性质。"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为模。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "模或层的有限型性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "submodule", "target_term": "子模", "context": "包含于给定模中的子模。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "模、层或茎之间的映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PD:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。在下述引理中，我们使用<TEXTITOPEN_0001>有限表示（finite presentation）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0002>代数（algebra）<MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>这一概念。这意味着对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>，都有<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>是一个（交换（commutative）的）<MATH_0007>代数（algebra），它作为<MATH_0008>代数（algebra）是有限表示（finite presentation）的。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该引理所讨论的概形。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给定底环或底层上的代数。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "覆盖中使用的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换", "context": "所述代数的乘法满足交换律。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给定底环或底层上的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给定底环或底层上的代数。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:05JS:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。设<MATH_0003>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0004>代数（algebra）。存在\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>一个有向集（directed set）<MATH_0005>（见《范畴（Categories）》定义<REF_0001>），\n<STRUCT_0003>一个系统（system）<MATH_0006>，它以<MATH_0007>为指标并取值于<MATH_0008>代数（algebras）的范畴（category），\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0009>代数（algebras）之间的态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0010>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n使得每个<MATH_0011>都是有限表示（finite presentation）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0012>代数（algebra），并且态射（morphisms）<MATH_0013>诱导一个同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0014>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "directed set", "target_term": "有向集"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "该引理所讨论的概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "底概形的拟紧性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "底概形的拟分离性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给定底环或底层上的代数。"}, {"source_term": "directed set", "target_term": "有向集", "context": "用来标引正向系统的有向集。"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引章节的名称，主题为范畴。"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统", "context": "以给定有向集为指标的系统。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用来构成范畴或考虑态射的代数。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "用对象及其态射给出的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用来构成范畴或考虑态射的代数。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所考虑范畴中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "模具有有限表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模或层的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "给定底环或底层上的代数。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所考虑范畴中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "模或茎之间的同构。"}], "notes": []}
